Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:37.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,八个世纪以前 一场鲜为人知的世仇血战  在处于统治地位的吸血鬼与大批叛变的狼人之间展开{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.45,0:00:42.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,传说中 战争是从不死族的长老  亚历山大·柯文纳斯的两个不死之子开始的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:46.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被蝙蝠咬伤的马库斯成为了吸血鬼之父{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:53.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被恶狼咬伤的威廉成为了第一个最强壮的狼人{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:08.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(公元1202年)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.03,0:01:31.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪 兄弟你都做了些什么啊？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.Brother, what have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:52.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们又一次目睹了这个野兽的暴行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet again we arrive to witness this monster's aftermath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能再这样忍受下去了 马库斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not tolerate this any longer, Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.05,0:02:00.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,必须阻止你的兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brother must be stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:02.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从今晚开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ends tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.93,0:02:06.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在他们变身之前 我们得快点行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must move quickly, before they turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.23,0:02:10.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他仍在这儿吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he still here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:13.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:16.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多 我们不能伤害他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor, he must not be harmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:18.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是答应过你了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave you my word, did I not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.57,0:02:21.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但威廉必须被控制住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But William must be controlled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:26.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,烧光尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn the bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:28.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搜索整个区域{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search the outbuildings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:30.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,分成两组 你给他们浇上油...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Form two groups.You, douse them with fuel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:31.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马库斯！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:34.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,留在我身边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:17.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我火把{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the torch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.55,0:03:23.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们变身了！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're turning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:26.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们变身了！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're turning!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:03.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,退到森林里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retreat to the woods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:05.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要留下来作战 你需要我的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll stay and fight.You need my help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:07.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.48,0:05:08.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你死了 我们全都活不成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you die, we all die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.78,0:05:10.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻走！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.85,0:05:12.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:37.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:38.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在哪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:40.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要更多人手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need more men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:42.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去找阿米莉亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find Amelia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:52.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿米莉亚 找到威廉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amelia, we found William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:20.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,围住他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surround him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.66,0:06:25.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:35.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.22,0:06:39.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放开他！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave him be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.49,0:06:44.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 会杀死他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop this, you're killing him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:48.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,加大力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.42,0:07:14.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.05,0:07:16.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马库斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:19.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不能伤害他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was not to be harmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:21.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,按照我们的约定 把他交给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Place him in my charge as we agreed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.93,0:07:24.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否则你会为欺骗而付出代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you will pay for your deceit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:27.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要学会一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you will learn your place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:30.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对这头野兽的同情简直是愚蠢透了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your sympathy for this beast is foolish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:33.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你兄弟已经完全失控了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brother is entirely beyond control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.57,0:07:35.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,必须按照我的方法解决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be done my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.32,0:07:40.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你很清楚杀死我或是威廉 结果是一样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know well the consequences if you murder me or William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.41,0:07:43.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你再提他的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you so much as speak his name again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:46.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就把他碎尸万段{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will have chosen that future for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.92,0:07:58.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要怎样处置他 主人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is thy will, my lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:03.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将他终身囚禁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lmprisonment for all time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:06.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离你越远越好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Far from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:20.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,六个世纪以来 我一直是吸血鬼家族的忠实斗士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For six centuries I was a loyal soldier of the Vampire clan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:24.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我遭到背叛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I was betrayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.24,0:08:29.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这场战争并不像表面看起来那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war was not as it had seemed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.55,0:08:30.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一夜之间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In one night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:35.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们联合在一起的谎言被揭穿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the lies that had united our kind had been exposed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:37.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱恩 是第二个领导者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kraven, our second-in-command{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:40.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和卢西恩建立了秘密的联盟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had formed a secret alliance with Lucian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.25,0:08:42.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狼人的领导者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ruler of the Werewolf clan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:45.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想推翻我们领导人维克多的统治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to overthrow Viktor, our leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.37,0:08:49.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但克莱恩的野心计划 最终以失败而告终{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Kraven's lust for power and domination had failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.81,0:08:55.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多也并非我想象中的救世主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor was not the saviour I had been led to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:08:59.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他背叛了我的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had betrayed us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.61,0:09:09.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不久 大家便开始找寻杀死他的凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon the hunt will be on for his killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.08,0:09:15.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我仅有一个同伴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have but one ally left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:17.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michael{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:20.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,柯文纳斯的人类后裔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the human descendant of Corvinus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.54,0:09:23.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,既非吸血鬼也非狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither Vampire nor Lycan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:25.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而是混血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but a hybrid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.59,0:09:31.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们被找到是迟早的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only a matter of time before we're found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:45.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《黑夜传说2:进化》
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.48,0:09:56.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在唯一的希望就是唤醒马库斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My only hope now is to awaken Marcus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:59.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们最后的一个长者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our last remaining elder{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并告知他真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and expose the truth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:05.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须抢在克莱恩趁他休眠杀死他之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before Kraven tries to murder him while he's still in hibernation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.79,0:10:11.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱恩知道他一旦苏醒 自己就死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kraven knows he's no match for him awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.91,0:10:50.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,棒极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.74,0:11:25.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他已死好几周了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing's been dead for weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:28.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得狼人死后会变成人形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought Lycans went back to their human form when they die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:29.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,确实如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.67,0:11:31.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他被注射了防退变的药物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's been given a serum to stop regression{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.41,0:11:33.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以做实验研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so it can be studied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.41,0:11:34.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you tell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:41.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(标本被注射了850毫升试剂：以防退化)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.59,0:11:44.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为 这不太像你的专长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite your department, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:45.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只杀他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just killed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.82,0:11:47.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会去研究他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't pay much attention to their anatomy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:50.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能呆多久？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long can we stay here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.47,0:11:51.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不久{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.55,0:11:54.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些房间全都连接在主控网上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These safe houses are all linked together on one mainframe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:56.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,动作传感器会探知哪里有活动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with motion sensors revealing which ones are active.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:59.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们已经被发现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone could have picked us up already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.36,0:12:09.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一小时天就亮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only about an hour till daylight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:12.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能在天亮前赶回来吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you even make it back to the mansion before sunrise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.20,0:12:13.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:15.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 咱们拿上东西就走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's get what we need and go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:16.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:20.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要一个人去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:41.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:27.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马库斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.00,0:14:33.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这肮脏的血液中储存的记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blood memories of this wretched creature, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.08,0:14:39.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经告诉我你的无耻背叛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have shown me that your treachery knows no bounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:43.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,主人 听我解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord, I can explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.58,0:14:46.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要听你的谎言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I listen to your lies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.89,0:14:50.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,探知真相的途径{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the journey to the truth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:56.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将是无比的甜美？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is so much sweeter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:05.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我替他保守秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kept his secrets, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.51,0:15:07.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,收拾残局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cleaned up the mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:09.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要在维克多面前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll go before Viktor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:11.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把我对你说的一字不差的告诉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tell him exactly what I tell you to!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:15.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只要尽好自己的本分就是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just concentrate on your part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:27.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:30.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我能够协助你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can assist you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:32.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能做的都已做了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you already have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:40.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果能申诉成功{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can plead my case, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.89,0:15:43.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你或许会被带到庇护所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's a chance you'll be granted sanctuary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:44.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 你会被当场击毙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now, you'll be killed on sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.99,0:15:46.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你冒险的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not prepared to risk it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.15,0:15:48.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那我干嘛 坐在这等你吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what am I supposed to do, sit and wait for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.05,0:15:49.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 克莱恩仍有很多手下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Kraven may still have his men with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:51.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能自己去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.10,0:15:52.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你并没有自己想象得那么强壮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not as strong as you might think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.86,0:15:54.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:55.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔 你是独一无二的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michael, you're unique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.98,0:15:57.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,之前 从未有过混血儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's never been a hybrid before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.18,0:15:59.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然而 你也会为此而感到矛盾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However ambivalent you might feel about it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.65,0:16:01.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 你的力量是无法估量的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the truth is your powers could be limitless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:03.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你必须依靠血液{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you depend on blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:05.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,血液是你的食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:06.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有血液 你会逐渐变得虚弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without it, you'll be growing weaker, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:08.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不需多久 就会验证的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the second.Use the time for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:11.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:14.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不需要？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what if I don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:15.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不依靠血液呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I can't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:18.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,普通的食物会使你丧命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Normal food could be lethal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.21,0:16:21.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果不能控制自己 你会攻击人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't anticipate your cravings, you will attack humans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.22,0:16:24.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 你不会想失去理智的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And believe me, you don't want that on your conscience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.18,0:16:27.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真的是不能再回头了 迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There really is no going back, Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:31.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:33.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你所做的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I understand what you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:35.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很感激{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm grateful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:39.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你救了我一命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.65,0:16:41.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对于死亡 我还没有心理准备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't ready to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.49,0:16:47.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:49.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都变得太快了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.32,0:16:51.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我需要点时间仔细想一想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I probably need just a minute to make it all fit in my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:55.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,突然发生的这一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a lot to process all at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:57.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:16:59.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会在这的等你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:01.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要保证你能够安全回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just make sure you come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:28.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:31.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些目击者...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The innocent who witnessed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.33,0:18:32.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道些什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they've been silenced?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:35.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,按您命令 他们什么都不清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But otherwise unharmed, as ordered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:41.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我看你的情报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me what you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:42.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:49.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两个死亡行者被杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two Death Dealers were killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.11,0:18:51.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没发现狼人的尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found no Lycan bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.29,0:18:53.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很显然 使用了一种新式武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently they were using a new kind of ammunition, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.37,0:18:55.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是某种紫外弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some sort of UV round.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.11,0:18:58.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿米莉亚呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amelia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:02.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有幸存者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:04.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看上去 好像克莱恩的手下也在场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems Kraven's men might have been present, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.99,0:19:07.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但好像没有去阻止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they did nothing to prevent it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:09.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Viktor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:33.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,残局里没有马库斯的痕迹吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no trace of Marcus amongst the ashes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:36.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他好像毁掉了自己的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems he destroyed his own coven, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:40.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那从来就不是他的家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was never his coven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:06.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.33,0:20:51.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我独自呆会儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.71,0:23:11.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到你了！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.94,0:24:15.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.83,0:24:38.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.75,0:25:48.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔·柯文...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michael Corvin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.57,0:26:01.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离我远一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to get away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.29,0:26:05.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.42,0:26:27.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在那！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.26,0:26:32.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻派人过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the men up there.Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.41,0:26:44.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的给我滚开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the fuck away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.65,0:27:18.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.89,0:28:47.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.86,0:28:56.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来 快喝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.67,0:28:57.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.74,0:28:59.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔 你会死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michael, you'll die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.62,0:29:27.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.43,0:29:29.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能动吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you move?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.56,0:29:34.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须躲起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.79,0:29:57.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马库斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.21,0:29:59.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你做了些什么 瑟琳娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you've done, Selene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.29,0:30:02.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多该死 克莱恩也是一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor deserved his fate and Kraven was no better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.01,0:30:08.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克莱恩已得到了应有的下场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kraven has already reaped the rewards of his own misdeeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.72,0:30:10.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至于维克多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Viktor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.55,0:30:14.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多死多少次都是活该{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor deserved his fate, many times over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.27,0:30:18.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个骇人听闻的交易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A terrible business, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.34,0:30:20.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他对你家人的残酷杀戮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the slaying of your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.48,0:30:25.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还费尽心思想对我隐瞒事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet so much effort was spent to conceal this matter from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.07,0:30:31.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多到底在隐瞒什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you suppose Viktor had to hide?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.76,0:30:35.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许是你吧 瑟琳娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or perhaps it is you, Selene{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.41,0:30:41.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,隐藏你这个悲惨家族中的最后一员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the last of your wretched family{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.83,0:30:44.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事情瞒着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has something to hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.76,0:30:55.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快走！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.95,0:31:20.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么鬼东西？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.56,0:31:24.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是否介意我来开？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.67,0:31:31.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.72,0:32:43.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何  我必将得到我想要的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dead or alive, you will give me what I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.51,0:33:58.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.02,0:34:03.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他可真是个狗杂种？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a hybrid, isn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.31,0:34:04.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.52,0:34:07.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他想要这东西 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted this.Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.98,0:34:10.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.81,0:34:12.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we have another problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.20,0:34:19.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从这边过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn off up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.79,0:34:25.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.17,0:34:27.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 趴下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.33,0:34:30.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,踩住油门 趴下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your foot on the gas, but stay down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.80,0:34:47.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.61,0:35:04.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,趴着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.87,0:36:00.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.93,0:36:19.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,手伸出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.00,0:36:21.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.55,0:36:24.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's really no need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.77,0:36:26.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.12,0:36:44.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 让我看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let me see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.25,0:36:50.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.04,0:36:52.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.80,0:40:42.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不在这里 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Area secure, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.75,0:42:11.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,日落了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sun's setting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.17,0:42:14.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.47,0:42:24.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,弹药都被拿走了 留下的只有一些武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The supplies were taken.Used weapons were left behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.90,0:42:26.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在日出前离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tavern events occurred just before dawn, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.63,0:42:27.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 他们走不远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so they couldn't have got very far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.93,0:42:29.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续搜索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remain airborne for the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.68,0:42:32.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我确信他们会再次出现的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure they'll reappear in good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.08,0:42:37.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.78,0:42:40.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我小时候见过这个东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen this before, when I was a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.28,0:42:42.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当时我拿在手里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've held it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.84,0:42:44.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像这样打开它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When it was open, like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.28,0:42:45.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is that possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.79,0:42:49.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.83,0:42:53.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但有一个人或许知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I know someone that might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.17,0:42:56.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,安德里亚斯·泰尼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Andreas Tanis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.34,0:42:59.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是联盟中的史学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was the official historian of the covens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.05,0:43:03.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他喜欢收录被{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He fell from favour after documenting what{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.81,0:43:05.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多认为的恶毒谎言 所以失宠了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor considered malicious lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.64,0:43:08.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 后来发现诸多记载确有其事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, as it turns out, he was probably telling the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.56,0:43:09.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他现在怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.06,0:43:12.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他三百年前被流放了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was exiled over 300 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.81,0:43:14.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三百年了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}300 years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.48,0:43:16.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么肯定我们现在能找到他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you think we're gonna find him now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.65,0:43:18.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是被我押送流放的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was the one who exiled him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.60,0:43:59.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来像是修道院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like a monastery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.39,0:44:01.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以前是 现在是一所监狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It used to be.More like a prison now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.10,0:44:04.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自维克多下令后 泰尼斯就一直被关在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tanis has been hiding there since Viktor's order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.73,0:44:07.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们将是这几世纪以来 第一个拜访他的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be the first people he's seen in centuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.40,0:44:20.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's odd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.48,0:44:21.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.83,0:44:24.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不记得有这扇门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember this gate being here before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.71,0:44:28.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿着这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.93,0:45:11.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(警告：内有猎犬)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.65,0:45:34.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.46,0:45:59.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,退后！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.01,0:46:03.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓住了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.32,0:46:07.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.53,0:48:43.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道是你 瑟琳娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it was you, Selene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.15,0:48:47.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的血液仍散发着维克多的腥臭味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stench of Viktor's blood still lingers in your veins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.61,0:48:49.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,泰尼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tanis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.28,0:48:51.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看你瞄准的功夫没什么长进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see your aim hasn't improved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.29,0:48:55.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一点都没变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.66,0:48:57.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不怕你 瑟琳娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't scare me, Selene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.46,0:49:00.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来 我还要继续努力啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we're gonna have to work on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.47,0:49:12.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.97,0:49:18.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的流放生活比我记忆中好得多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your exile seems a bit more comfortable than I remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.48,0:49:21.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候吸血鬼开始雇佣狼人当保镖了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does a Vampire have Lycan bodyguards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.90,0:49:22.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一件礼物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.19,0:49:25.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来自一个很有说服力的客户{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From a most persuasive client.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.98,0:49:27.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.11,0:49:30.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么卢西恩要保护你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would Lucian wanna protect you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.32,0:49:33.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们之间有交易{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he was trading with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.99,0:49:37.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,紫外弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}UV rounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.20,0:49:41.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以残杀自己的族人为交易有多久了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have you been in the business of killing your own kind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.21,0:49:44.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做的一切都是为了生存{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've done what's necessary to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.33,0:49:48.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我决心要安定生活的时候 你敬重的维克多背叛了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My decision was made easy the day your precious Viktor betrayed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.84,0:49:51.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,背叛可是他的专长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Betrayal was something he did very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.01,0:49:55.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多死了 我杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor's dead.I killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.93,0:49:57.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.51,0:49:59.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了维克多？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill Viktor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.35,0:50:05.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我才不信呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I think not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.52,0:50:09.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 除非你知道真相的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, unless you've learned the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.07,0:50:14.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.88,0:50:16.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你终于知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So your eyes are finally open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.16,0:50:22.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,隐藏的真相甚至比谎言更难以接受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it interesting how the truth is even harder to absorb than light?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.16,0:50:25.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 你要知道 我试图想劝说他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I tried to stop him, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.54,0:50:28.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很滑稽 他犯下了这样的罪行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A travesty, committing such a horrible crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.54,0:50:31.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,竟然瞒过了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then turning you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.92,0:50:33.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他做得太过份了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was too much to take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.03,0:50:36.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我反对他的做法 所以被关在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My protests are why he put me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.55,0:50:39.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心一点 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful with that, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.84,0:50:41.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那东西威力很大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Makes a terrible bang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.39,0:50:43.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,打开刀片后就会爆炸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the blades and they're active.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.64,0:50:46.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太感谢了！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.69,0:50:52.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多把你关在这一定有他的理由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor put you here for a reason, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.50,0:50:55.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我怀疑是因为你隐瞒了一些事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I doubt it was because you had moral qualms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.98,0:50:56.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底知道些什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.99,0:50:59.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕我什么都不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very little of anything, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.88,0:51:05.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.34,0:51:09.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我看走眼了 原来你没有任何利用价值{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then, perhaps I'm mistaken and there's no use for you at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.90,0:51:13.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马库斯想得到这个 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcus was after this.Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.73,0:51:59.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些历史是真实的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some history is based on truth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.74,0:52:03.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而有些确实是谎言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and others on deception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.67,0:52:07.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多并不是你们所认为的第一个吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor was not the first of our kind, as you were led to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.99,0:52:10.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他以前是个人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was once human{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.68,0:52:13.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,统治着一部分土地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the ruler of these lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.42,0:52:16.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马库斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.84,0:52:19.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是唯一的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's the one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.62,0:52:22.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,源头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The source.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.01,0:52:25.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真正的第一个吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first true Vampire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.52,0:52:28.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那传言就是真的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the legend is true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.73,0:52:32.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在他奄奄一息的时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toward the end of his ruthless life, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.77,0:52:37.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对于维克多而言 生命比黄金、白银还要珍贵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the next breath meant more to Viktor than silver or gold, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.17,0:52:38.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马库斯找到了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marcus came{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.79,0:52:40.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with an offer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.24,0:52:44.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以永远摆脱疾病和死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a reprieve from sickness and death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.88,0:52:46.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可以获得永生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Immortality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.99,0:52:50.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,作为回报 维克多必须率领军队来帮助他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in return, Viktor was to use his army-turned-immortal to help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.34,0:52:53.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助他什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.08,0:52:55.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,控制住第一个狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To defeat the very first Werewolves, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.56,0:52:58.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他非常危险 并具有极强的感染力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a dangerous and infectious breed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.66,0:53:01.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,与马库斯有着同样的血统{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}created by Marcus' own flesh and blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.35,0:53:04.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的孪生兄弟 威廉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His twin brother, William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.88,0:53:08.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他和现在的狼人还不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these weren't the Lycans we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.84,0:53:11.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的同伴或许很让人厌烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disgusting though your brethren may be, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.25,0:53:13.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但至少他们进化了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they at least are evolved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.42,0:53:15.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些狂暴的野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, these were raging monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.88,0:53:19.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,永远不会再变回人形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never able to take human form again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.38,0:53:22.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们的后代学会了如何控制自己的怒火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was only later generations that learned to channel their rage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.72,0:53:26.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉的狂暴与毁灭是永无休止的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And William's appetite for destruction and rampage was insatiable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.78,0:53:29.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此 必须阻止他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had to be stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.35,0:53:31.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多的士兵变成了吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so once Viktor's army was turned, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.98,0:53:34.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他率领大批的吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the legions of Vampires under his control{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.56,0:53:37.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,追捕和消灭这些野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tracked down and destroyed the animals, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.98,0:53:39.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还捉住了威廉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then captured William{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.90,0:53:41.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并把他关在了很远的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and locked him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.90,0:53:44.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,永远的被维克多所囚禁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor's prisoner for all time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.74,0:53:48.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要让他活着？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why let him live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.16,0:53:51.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这与维克多从来都维护马库斯原因一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the very same reason that Viktor never conspired against Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.43,0:53:52.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恐惧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.87,0:53:55.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人告诫他 马库斯要是死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was warned that, should Marcus ever be killed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.37,0:53:58.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的吸血鬼都将会随他而亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all those in his bloodline would follow him to the grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.46,0:54:01.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此 在维克多的头脑中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So in Viktor's mind, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.58,0:54:04.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉兄弟的死将意味着一切都会消失{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William's death would mean the end for all Lycans, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.50,0:54:06.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此 他受马库斯的支配{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.67,0:54:09.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.34,0:54:12.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个聪明的谎言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, a clever deception, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.63,0:54:15.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而维克多根本不敢冒这个险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but one Viktor was hardly willing to put to the test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.76,0:54:18.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,于是他要保护马库斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so Marcus was protected{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.10,0:54:21.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不惜一切代价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at all costs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.55,0:54:26.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 没错 找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, yes, here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.44,0:54:33.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampires?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.16,0:54:35.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mortals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.07,0:54:38.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,与所有人都颇有渊源的亚历山大·柯文纳斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men loyal to Alexander Corvinus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.95,0:54:42.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们所有人的祖先{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The father of us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.25,0:54:51.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.46,0:54:56.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.29,0:54:59.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉被囚禁的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's William's prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.30,0:55:05.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲奉命建造的监狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The prison your father was commissioned to build.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.50,0:55:13.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要为我看护这里 知道吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you've been the one keeping a watch over this for me, have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.89,0:55:16.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我正在到处找它 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been searching everywhere for this, my darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.34,0:55:22.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.29,0:55:25.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不对吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.48,0:55:28.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她终于明白她的家人为何被杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She now understands why her family was killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.28,0:55:33.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但那是多年之后的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that was many years later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.99,0:55:36.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是卢西恩逃脱的那个冬天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The winter of Lucian's escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.03,0:55:39.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲知道的事情太多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father knew too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.24,0:55:41.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至少对于维克多来说 太多 太危险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or too much for Viktor to risk, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.54,0:55:43.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其当卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially when Lucian{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.29,0:55:47.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿到威廉的监狱钥匙后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had the key to William's cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.62,0:55:50.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我就是囚禁室的地图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.33,0:55:52.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.88,0:55:58.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是唯一知道囚禁室位置的幸存者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only one still living who has seen its location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.30,0:56:01.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦...维克多认为你那时太小 还不记事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Viktor realized you'd be too young to remember explicitly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.69,0:56:05.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但马库斯可以获取{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Marcus knows that the memory, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.76,0:56:09.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉监狱的确切的位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and therefore the exact location of William's prison{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.89,0:56:11.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,通过隐藏在你血液里的记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is hidden away in your blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.10,0:56:15.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么马库斯现在要找他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is Marcus looking for him now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.66,0:56:17.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经过了这么多久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after all this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.00,0:56:20.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这我无法回答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I cannot answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.23,0:56:32.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我知道一个能阻止他的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I do know someone who could stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.88,0:56:34.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我可以安排你们见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps I could arrange a meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.29,0:56:40.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们必须放我一马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In exchange for your discretion, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.91,0:56:43.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.42,0:57:40.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,泰尼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tanis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.36,0:57:42.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好像很不安{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem anxious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.09,0:57:44.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么一看见我就要跑？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you flee the very sight of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.80,0:57:50.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.09,0:57:53.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坐吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.93,0:57:57.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不必这么惧怕我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no need for this to be unpleasant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.89,0:58:01.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我对你一直很满意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always rather enjoyed your company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.31,0:58:09.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就不太友善了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're being rude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.97,0:58:12.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.41,0:58:22.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多造了两把钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor struck two keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.12,0:58:24.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道它们吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.62,0:58:28.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.12,0:58:32.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道什么钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know of any keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.00,0:58:49.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.72,0:58:51.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 你是说那些钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, those keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.60,0:58:53.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.62,0:58:56.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 一个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, one was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.10,0:58:58.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放在很明显的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One was kept in plain sight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.06,0:59:01.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就戴在他女儿的脖子上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}draped around his daughter's neck, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.02,0:59:03.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你很容易就能看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}right there for you to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.52,0:59:05.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.19,0:59:08.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多一直带着它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kept with Viktor at all times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.85,0:59:10.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在哪？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.24,0:59:12.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在他的体内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Within him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.53,0:59:16.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,藏在皮肉下面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beneath the flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.77,0:59:27.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请 请不要 求你了 别杀我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.Please.I beg you.Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.17,0:59:46.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...可以阻止他的人 或许我可以安排你们见面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Who could stop him.Perhaps I could arrange a meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.80,0:59:48.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到17号码头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to pier 17.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.27,0:59:50.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找洛伦兹·马卡罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask for Lorenz Macaro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.11,1:00:16.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道泰尼斯不是在骗我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we know Tanis isn't setting us up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.37,1:00:18.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他还没有骗我的胆量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not brave enough to set me up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.09,1:00:24.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们闯进了私人领地{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.88,1:00:27.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢从车里走出来 让我看到你的手{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.92,1:00:30.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来这里找洛伦兹·马卡罗{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.72,1:00:32.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从车里出来 慢慢的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.55,1:00:34.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把手放在我能看见的地方{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.89,1:00:37.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想看我的手是吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.60,1:00:45.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以下去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.40,1:00:58.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好像很熟悉这东西？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're familiar with this, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.23,1:01:08.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常熟悉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intimately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.58,1:01:16.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是亚历山大·柯文纳斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Alexander Corvinus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.75,1:01:26.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有一段时间是用过这个名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a time that I was known by that name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.51,1:01:31.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论什么名字 我始终是你的祖先{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By any name, I am still your forefather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.98,1:01:40.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么多世纪 你是如何藏匿行踪的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How have you stayed hidden all these years?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.48,1:01:42.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几世纪以来 眼看着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For centuries I've stood by and watched the havoc{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.06,1:01:46.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我子孙后代间的争斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my sons have wrought upon each other{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.26,1:01:48.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以及对人类的伤害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and upon humanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.28,1:01:51.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我祈求这不是我造成的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the legacy I prayed for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.28,1:01:53.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看着他们凌晨进入这个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the morning I watched them enter this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.02,1:01:57.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经厌倦了这个工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a tiresome duty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.31,1:02:00.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,遏制争斗 清理残局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}keeping the war contained, cleaning up the mess, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.41,1:02:04.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,隐藏家族悲惨的历史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hiding my family's unfortunate history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.91,1:02:06.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么不阻止呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't you have stopped it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.43,1:02:08.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.70,1:02:10.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们能杀死你的儿子吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you kill your own sons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.95,1:02:13.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道马库斯要做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what Marcus will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.49,1:02:16.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他找到我 也就找到囚禁威廉地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he finds me, he finds William's prison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.00,1:02:19.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须帮我们阻止他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to help us stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.01,1:02:23.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我帮你杀死我儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are asking me to help you kill my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.05,1:02:25.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.60,1:02:27.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个死亡行者？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Death Dealer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.47,1:02:30.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在六个世纪里 你杀了多少无辜的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many innocents did you kill in the six-century{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.72,1:02:32.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了替你的家族复仇{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}quest to avenge your family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.43,1:02:35.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我讲什么正义宣言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spare me your self-righteous declarations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.42,1:02:37.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你与马库斯没什么区别{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are no different from Marcus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.20,1:02:40.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至还不如威廉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and even less noble than William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.60,1:02:42.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至少他无法控制自己的怒火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least he cannot control his savagery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.31,1:02:46.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的所作所为都是因你而起的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything I've done can be laid at your feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.44,1:02:48.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几十万无辜的人被杀 都因你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hundreds of thousands have died because of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.45,1:02:49.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接受不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your inability to accept that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.77,1:02:51.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你两个儿子均是怪物的事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your sons are monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.85,1:02:53.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而他们还制造出更多的怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that they create monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.76,1:02:55.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你完全可以阻止这一切的发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could've stopped all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.51,1:02:57.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别以为你可以在这对我指手画脚...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not come grovelling to me simply{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.90,1:03:00.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就因为你比对手弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you are weaker than your adversary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.08,1:03:02.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也看到了威廉所酿成的惨状{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the devastation William caused{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.62,1:03:04.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在没被囚禁起来以前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before he was captured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.33,1:03:06.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不能被放出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He cannot be set free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.25,1:03:56.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 等一等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.01,1:03:58.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本无法与他对抗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're no match for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.02,1:04:22.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就快了 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.63,1:04:57.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.18,1:05:10.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.06,1:05:12.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.60,1:05:16.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经死了 我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've gone.there, my child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.51,1:05:18.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在安全了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are safe now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.75,1:06:08.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.88,1:06:11.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.55,1:06:15.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.73,1:06:17.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.86,1:06:44.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.12,1:06:48.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.80,1:06:58.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.93,1:07:00.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,醒过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.49,1:07:06.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.65,1:07:54.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.90,1:07:57.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这里不欢迎你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are unwelcome in my presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.70,1:08:00.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.54,1:08:04.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一颗可以预知未来、永不停止的心脏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The predictable heart that never thaws.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.98,1:08:07.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜在愚蠢人的体内跳动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pity it beats within such a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.98,1:08:11.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不死族中最年长的长老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The eldest of the immortals, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.24,1:08:15.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,却从未尝试掌握自己的命运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yet you have made no attempt to seize your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.36,1:08:20.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我都是异类 仅此而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are oddities of nature, you and I.Nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.21,1:08:23.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是属于人类的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a world for humanity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.86,1:08:28.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你对抛弃亲生骨肉而做出的无聊解释吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that petty sentiment explains why you rejected your sons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.20,1:08:30.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是在过去六个世纪里 你眼看着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you stood by for over half a millennium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.67,1:08:34.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉独自在黑暗中受尽折磨的原因吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as William suffered alone in darkness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.89,1:08:36.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.88,1:08:40.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法理解你那套无聊的情感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no respect for your petty sentiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.83,1:08:44.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多的钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor's key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.64,1:08:46.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.10,1:08:48.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无论什么计划 你都不要对威廉抱有任何幻想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever plan you have for William is futile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.87,1:08:50.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你无法控制他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot control your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.20,1:08:52.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我现在强壮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I am stronger now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.35,1:08:53.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们俩的关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And our bond is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.42,1:08:55.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,远比你所想象的要好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}greater than you have ever wanted to acknowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.52,1:08:56.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.02,1:09:00.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很快你就会淹没在狼人的海洋中 就像以前一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon you'll be drowning in Lycans, just like before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.58,1:09:02.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不会有狼人 父亲...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, not Lycans, Father...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.68,1:09:04.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or Vampires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.88,1:09:06.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个全新的种族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A new race, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.69,1:09:08.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将被他们的缔造者所创建{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}created in the image of their maker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.56,1:09:12.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个新的上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their new god{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.98,1:09:16.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.07,1:09:31.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个真正的上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a true god{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.99,1:09:37.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是没有父亲的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has no father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.77,1:10:15.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你终将要失败{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.47,1:10:52.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快拿医药箱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the kit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.24,1:10:54.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.56,1:11:02.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请不要 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.30,1:11:04.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们救你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let us help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.61,1:11:06.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时辰到了 我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The time has come, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.04,1:11:09.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去找那个女孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.96,1:11:13.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带她来见我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring her to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.54,1:11:20.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 等等 等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait.Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.51,1:11:26.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你如果想对付马库斯 就需要亚历山大的帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want Marcus, you'll need Alexander's help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.93,1:11:34.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要把他留在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave him here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.12,1:11:57.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他得到你那把钥匙了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he get the pendant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.26,1:11:59.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.78,1:12:02.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对于你来说他太强壮了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's too powerful for you alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.79,1:12:04.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是唯一比他年长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the only one older than he is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.04,1:12:07.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一比他强壮的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only one stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.21,1:12:09.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以亲手杀了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have killed him yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.79,1:12:13.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管他变成什么样...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter what he's become...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.21,1:12:17.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他终究是我的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he is my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.13,1:12:25.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是最后的希望了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the last hope left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.64,1:12:29.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一种方法可以击败他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is only one way to defeat him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.47,1:12:39.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly, now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.48,1:12:43.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,趁我血液里的遗留物还没有消散以前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before there is no more legacy left in my veins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.19,1:12:54.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会变成什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will I become?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.00,1:12:57.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.52,1:13:42.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.70,1:17:31.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经接近了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.62,1:18:28.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,调头 绕到河那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head back around towards the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.72,1:18:42.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没看到有任何入口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see a way inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.30,1:18:47.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以前在那有个入口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There used to be a river entrance just there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.51,1:18:49.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在一定是被淹没了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must be submerged now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.77,1:18:51.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来得游过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we're getting wet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.59,1:19:29.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,靠近点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.76,1:19:36.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瑟琳娜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Selene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.72,1:20:51.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.33,1:21:08.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.88,1:21:14.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 威廉 停下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, William.Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.95,1:21:16.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be still, brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.97,1:21:18.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.80,1:21:24.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伤害你就等于伤害我自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd no sooner harm you than myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.15,1:21:59.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪条路？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.30,1:22:28.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是这里吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.43,1:22:34.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's already here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.12,1:23:09.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.84,1:23:11.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.09,1:23:14.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.34,1:23:26.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来迟一步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.19,1:23:56.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,追上去 跟在后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After him.Get behind him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.04,1:24:07.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真不可思议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.60,1:25:17.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔 你是独一无二的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michael, you're unique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.60,1:25:21.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,之前 从未有过混血儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's never been a hybrid before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.39,1:25:25.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的力量是无法估量的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your powers could be limitless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.62,1:25:44.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别开火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.43,1:25:46.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.58,1:25:50.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.52,1:25:52.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他从那边过去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went right through there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.14,1:25:55.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们仅有紫外弹 对他不起作用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we have are UV rounds.They won't take him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.00,1:25:58.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,的确不能 但能减缓他的速度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but they'll slow him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.75,1:26:46.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.72,1:26:47.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.82,1:28:06.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.65,1:30:00.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他和现在的狼人还不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these weren't the Lycans we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.34,1:30:01.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些狂暴的野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, these were raging monsters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.78,1:30:03.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,永远不会再变回人形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unable to take human form ever again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.66,1:30:56.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在等什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.01,1:30:56.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快开枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.94,1:30:59.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我会伤到她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.Not without taking her out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.33,1:31:00.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法瞄准目标{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't get a shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.58,1:31:54.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迈克尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Michael.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.11,1:32:32.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干掉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.47,1:33:06.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,切断缆绳！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut us loose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.23,1:33:11.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要坠毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.47,1:34:52.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉！{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.56,1:35:06.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 维克多留下你当作宠物是个错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew Viktor made a mistake by keeping you as a pet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.18,1:35:11.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他应该把你和你的家人一起杀了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He should have killed you with the rest of your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.90,1:38:01.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个无法预知的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An unknown chapter lies ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.95,1:38:04.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,随着族群间的界限日趋模糊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lines that had divided the clans have now been blurred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.45,1:38:08.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,混乱和杀戮是在所难免{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chaos and infighting are inevitable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.58,1:38:11.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一确定的就是我们仍将面对黑暗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that is certain is that darkness is still ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.33,1:38:14.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然而在此时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.07,1:38:16.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the first time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.30,1:38:18.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在曙光中看到了希望...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I look into the light with new hope...{\r}
